## Final Verdict Statement

**MAJOR REVISION**

*Justification*: The manuscript presents an exceptionally well-engineered system with clear architecture, transaction safety, dual-provider resilience, and a certified reproducible benchmark harness. However, as a scientific journal paper, evaluating on only 5 synthetic documents ($N=5$) prevents any meaningful statistical analysis or generalization claims. Furthermore, draft citation placeholders (`[NEEDS VERIFICATION]`) must be resolved. Upon executing the 500-document evaluation run ($N=500$) and disaggregating pre- vs. post-HITL extraction metrics, this manuscript will be fully suitable for publication in a top-tier IEEE/ACM journal.
